    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I wish to have K, D-dimensional ordered vectors. The constraint I wish to impose is that the 1st element in these K vectors are ordered such that if:<div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">parameters</span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    ordered</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">D</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>mu[1][1]&lt;mu[2][1]&lt;....&lt;mu[D][1]</div><div><br></div><div>Is there a way to impose this restriction?</div><div><br></div><div>One way I can think of imposing this restriction is by introducing a latent variable such that</div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">mu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">][</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">][</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> pos</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">//where pos is a positive random variable</span></div></code></div><br></div><div>however, I feel like there might be a better way.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div>Sachin</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
