">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">//where pos is a positive random variable</span></div></code></div><br></div><div>however, I feel like there might be a better way.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div>Sachin</div></div></blockquote></div>"
